{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":581577,\"title\":\"Persian Lessons\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Occupied France, 1942. Gilles is arrested by SS soldiers alongside other Jews and sent to a camp in Germany. He narrowly avoids sudden execution by swearing to the guards that he is not Jewish, but Persian. This lie temporarily saves him, but Gilles gets assigned a life-or-death mission: to teach Farsi to Head of Camp Koch, who dreams of opening a restaurant in Iran once the war is over. Through an ingenious trick, Gilles manages to survive by inventing words of \\\"Farsi\\\" every day and teaching them to Koch.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ppReRGszmdZC2194keN4cGoLIPQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kgP4YOUWKhJZWL0Z8LJ6G6LBMEM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":537,\"year\":2020,\"runtime\":127,\"genres\":[\"War\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"RU\",\"name\":\"Russia\"},{\"code\":\"DE\",\"name\":\"Germany\"},{\"code\":\"BY\",\"name\":\"Belarus\"},{\"code\":\"FR\",\"name\":\"France\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":3825668,\"director\":\"Vadim Perelman\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":78118,\"name\":\"Vadim Perelman\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yFZ2C4QiD35F4eblRSBpNUimrYD.jpg\"},{\"id\":66957,\"name\":\"Nahuel Pérez Biscayart\",\"character\":\"Gilles\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/27JLQmsKTwKO3WbIVJyBE4iI7za.jpg\"},{\"id\":111420,\"name\":\"Lars Eidinger\",\"character\":\"Klaus Koch\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l42T2eq3UTlQWsGlpIJUTyyp7sp.jpg\"},{\"id\":585492,\"name\":\"Jonas Nay\",\"character\":\"Max\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bBzLIK6mS6PIqxGy7EydONZdZ1z.jpg\"},{\"id\":119065,\"name\":\"Leonie Benesch\",\"character\":\"Elsa\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dXs2srrTNOTOZXNa0UOaO9xx2QL.jpg\"},{\"id\":4796,\"name\":\"Alexander Beyer\",\"character\":\"Camp Commander\",\